{"resourceIdentifier":"4794","resourceName":"Leiyang Hexi Animal Manure Composting Project","description":"Leiyang Hexi Animal Manure Composting Project (hereafter referred to as “the Project”) is a centralized manure treatment plant established in Group 1, Wufeng Village, Xiaoshui Town Leiyang City, Hengyang City, Hunan Province, People's Republic of China. The project recycles animal manure from local swine farms in Leiyang City and removes solids through a solid liquid separation system. \r\nPrior to the implementation of the project, manure from swine barns was left to decay in uncovered lagoons for uncontrolled anaerobic decay and was used seasonally for irrigation. The lagoons were barely fully drained and cleaned , and the methane produced was not recovered and was emitted directly to the atmosphere.The project activity, which introduces an animal manure composting system associated with solid separation techniques, avoids methane emissions through the separation of manure solids that are prevented from entering uncovered anaerobic lagoons, and further eliminates any potentials for methane emissions from the manure solids, as well as lowers the risk of exceeding nutrient application limits in the irrigation lands.","location":{"latitude":26.347220,"longitude":112.809944},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-11-22","endExclusive":"2023-12-23","endInclusive":"2023-12-22"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4794"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hunan"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Leiyang Cailun Contemporary Agricultural Science and Technology Park Development Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Hunan Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86 2123019950"},{"type":"string","value":"3542346576@qq.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"59972"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-I.D.,AMS-III.F.,AMS-III.Y"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"13/11/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 28/03/2022 - 27/03/2029"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=101286&IDKEY=j98klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8dk139673394","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"03-Leiyang_Listing Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-10-30T08:27:35.213Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=102181&IDKEY=fq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhd140907599","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_PCP_4794_30OCT2023.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-11-15T15:07:28.547Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=122309&IDKEY=m903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdf4168664111","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"01-VCS PDMR479428MAR2022-30SEP2023_v3.0-240906-clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-11-13T13:07:04.953Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=108445&IDKEY=l0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9l149545655","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"08-Leiyang_VCS Registration Representation 4794.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-02-28T13:18:02.493Z"},{"u